This repository holds the owner's design material for one house: the rebuild of the single-family
residence at 220 Laurel Dr, Altadena, California (APN 5832-003-027). That includes the floor plans,
site plans, drawing sets, DXF files, 3D models, renders, documents and the scripts that produce them.

No license is granted. The plans and drawings are architectural works protected by copyright. Without
the owner's written permission you may not:

  - copy, reproduce or redistribute them, in whole or in part;
  - adapt them or make derivative plans or drawings from them;
  - build, or have anyone build, any structure from them, on this site or any other;
  - submit them, or anything derived from them, to any permitting agency;
  - sell, license or otherwise use them commercially.

The repository is public so the owner can share it with the people working on this project. Viewing it
on GitHub, and the copying GitHub's Terms of Service permit within GitHub (such as viewing and forking),
does not grant any of the rights above.

The project's architect, engineers, consultants, contractors and the reviewing agencies may use the
material for this project only.

Not for construction. The drawings are owner-prepared drafts. They have not been reviewed or approved
by a licensed architect or engineer or by any permitting agency, and they are provided "as is", without
warranty of any kind. The owner accepts no liability for any use of them.

Permission requests: open an issue on the repository.
